      <rules>
        <rule id="be94-b996-83ca-d079" name="Warmaster Titan" hidden="false">
          <description>Fan rules, not part of EpicAU: adapted from the Epic-UK Adeptus Titanicus codex (version 080925), where it is a 0-1 Support Titan costing 1500 pts with weapons and is meant mainly for friendly games. Here its carapace weapon is chosen at EpicAU weapon costs. It has built-in AA guns, so no Air Defence upgrade. Priced between a fully armed Warlord and the 1350 pt Emperor-class Titans, which are tougher and better armed. Like them it is a Lord of War with no limit.</description>
        </rule>
      </rules>
